{"unit_id":"lumoping__dsh-todo-inbox#card-zh","repo":"lumoping/dsh-todo-inbox","commit":"21cb2506813f14195e4344f8263458538eb95c69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-todo-inbox 是面向 DSH Web 的跨会话待办收件箱插件。它在主机注册 inbox_add、inbox_update、inbox_done 和 inbox_list 工具，并向每个会话加入待办记录规则；浏览器端把待办区放入侧边栏底部，显示未完成数量和条目详情。条目保存在本机 JSON 文件中，也可从侧边栏查看、打开关联链接、跳回来源会话、标记完成或删除。适合多个会话并行、需要集中追踪人工审批或后续处理事项的用户；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:88-104"]}
{"unit_id":"lumoping__dsh-todo-inbox#card-en","repo":"lumoping/dsh-todo-inbox","commit":"21cb2506813f14195e4344f8263458538eb95c69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-todo-inbox is a DSH Web plugin for cross-session follow-ups. Agents can add, update, list, and complete todos; the sidebar displays pending items and links to source sessions. Data persists in a local JSON file. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:88-104"]}
